OL,3,ALindsay Clancy in court for first time
OL,4,Asince murder trial collapsed
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS mother Lindsay Clancy is back in
OL,7,Fcourt today after her murder trial
OL,8,Fcollapsed earlier this month - watch
OL,9,Fthe hearing live above
OL,11,FWhat could happen today? Clancy's
OL,12,Flawyer wants the case dismissed while
OL,13,Fprosecutors may announce plans for a
OL,14,Fretrial
OL,16,FClancy, 36, has admitted killing her
OL,17,Fchildren, but she pleaded not guilty to
OL,18,Fmurder, arguing she had postpartum
OL,19,Fpsychosis at the time ` who were Cora,
OL,20,FDawson and Callan?
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
